d I asked him what he thought of cryptocurrency.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 FLOYD MAYWEATHER, WORLD CHAMPION BOXER: I just think everybody should have their own mind and choose what cryptocurrency they want to choose.\par \par \uc2 What I believe in, just being independent, and doing what you want to do. And it's about people winning in life. And I push people to be winners in life, because I'm a winner.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 LI: Yes, we also had \uc2 Jack Dorsey\uc2  that's speaking here. Tomorrow, you have Tony Hawk, the skateboarder.\par \par \uc2 But in case you haven't heard, crypto, Bitcoin have really taken over the financial world. Bitcoin is up 300 percent. You have gotten more in Ethereum and \uc2 Dogecoin\uc2  and other coins as well.\par \par \uc2 But I will tell you that the risks here, at least a lot of the experts say that it could be the government stepping in. There might be more regulation. That might kill the party. Of course, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , the big whale, undisputed whale, when it comes to crypto, and what he says in his tweets.\par \par \uc2 By the way, Neil, we're finished day one here of Bitcoin 2021. But we will see you soon.\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: Wow. Bigger crowds there than I think at Disneyland. That's not too shabby.\par \par \uc2 All right, thank you very much, Susan Li in Miami, for that big powwow.\par \par \uc2 I think that technology is here to stay. The question is, will it be rewarding for investors wanting to stay with it? We will be following up on that.\par \par \uc2 Also following up on \uc2 Leon Panetta\uc2 , remember, the former CIA director, saying that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  should still meet with \uc2 Vladimir Putin\uc2  even with all these hack attacks on our country?\par \par \uc2 Someone who says that would be a mistake, the meeting should be canceled -- after this.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 CAVUTO: If this did, in fact,